{"seq":3,"slug":"nonfiction-narrative","title":"非虚构叙事","stage":"DONE","category":"storytelling-narrative","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 非虚构叙事\n\n非虚构叙事是一种以真实事件、真实人物和可验证事实为基础，同时运用文学技巧来构建引人入胜故事的写作形式。它拒绝虚构，却不放弃叙事的魅力——这正是它最核心的张力所在。从杜鲁门·卡波特（Truman Capote）的《冷血》到琼·狄迪恩（Joan Didion）的《奇想之年》，从特雷西·基德尔（Tracy Kidder）的《新机器的灵魂》到盖伊·特立斯（Gay Talese）的《被仰望与被遗忘的》，非虚构叙事在过去半个多世纪里逐渐从新闻报道的附庸成长为独立而成熟的文学体裁。\n\n本知识库从四个维度系统梳理非虚构叙事的理论与实践。**文学新闻**追溯从新新闻主义运动到当代深度报道的演进，探讨沉浸式报道和人物特写的核心技法；**回忆录与散文**聚焦以个人经验为素材的非虚构写作，涵盖回忆录、个人散文和抒情散文三种形式；**纪实叙事媒介**将视野拓展到纪录片、播客和数据可视化等当代叙事载体，考察非虚构故事如何在不同媒介中生长；**真实性与伦理**直面非虚构写作最根本的承诺——对事实的忠诚，讨论事实核查方法、叙事伦理困境以及 AI 技术对非虚构领域带来的冲击与可能。\n\n无论你是想要提升深度报道能力的记者、正在构思第一部回忆录的写作者，还是对纪实叙事感兴趣的内容创作者，这份学习路径都将帮助你在「真实」与「故事」之间找到自己的叙事声音。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"literary-journalism","title":"文学新闻","docCount":3,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/literary-journalism","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"new-journalism","title":"新新闻主义 New Journalism","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/literary-journalism/new-journalism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"immersion-reporting","title":"沉浸式报道 Immersion Reporting","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/literary-journalism/immersion-reporting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"profile-writing","title":"人物特写 Profile Writing","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/literary-journalism/profile-writing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"memoir-essay","title":"回忆录与散文","docCount":3,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/memoir-essay","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"memoir-craft","title":"回忆录写作 Memoir Craft","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/memoir-essay/memoir-craft"},{"seq":2,"slug":"personal-essay","title":"个人散文 Personal Essay","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/memoir-essay/personal-essay"},{"seq":3,"slug":"lyric-essay","title":"抒情散文 Lyric Essay","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/memoir-essay/lyric-essay"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"documentary-narrative","title":"纪实叙事媒介","docCount":3,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/documentary-narrative","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"documentary-storytelling","title":"纪录片叙事 Documentary Storytelling","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/documentary-narrative/documentary-storytelling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"podcast-audio-narrative","title":"播客与音频叙事 Podcast & Audio Narrative","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/documentary-narrative/podcast-audio-narrative"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-storytelling","title":"数据叙事 Data Storytelling","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/documentary-narrative/data-storytelling"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"truth-ethics","title":"真实性与伦理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/truth-ethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fact-checking-verification","title":"事实核查与验证 Fact-Checking & Verification","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/truth-ethics/fact-checking-verification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"narrative-ethics","title":"叙事伦理 Narrative Ethics","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/truth-ethics/narrative-ethics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-nonfiction","title":"AI 与非虚构写作 AI & Nonfiction Writing","url":"/h/storytelling-narrative/nonfiction-narrative/truth-ethics/ai-nonfiction"}]}]}